Step 9 – Configure Amazon Nova Lite
Objective: Configure the Strands agent to use Amazon Nova Lite through Amazon Bedrock.

Run this command from inside StudentAgent:
cat > app/agent/model/load.py <<'EOF'
import os
from strands.models.bedrock import BedrockModel


def load_model() -> BedrockModel:
    """Load Amazon Nova Lite through Amazon Bedrock."""

    model_id = os.environ.get("MODEL_INFERENCE_PROFILE_ARN")

    if not model_id:
        raise ValueError(
            "MODEL_INFERENCE_PROFILE_ARN environment variable is not set"
        )

    return BedrockModel(
        model_id=model_id,
        region_name=os.environ.get("AWS_REGION", "ap-south-1")
    )
EOF


